    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Warm up with award-winning Soprano, Floralove Katz; Pianist, Natasha Guiller, and Friends for a memorable evening of sing-along Holiday, Yiddish, Classical Standards, and other songs.  Enjoy solo performances by brilliant, young string musicians, with Pianist Liko Yamane. Close out this stellar show with New Year's, and other favourites.\n\nArtists:\n\n\n\tFloralove Katz: Soprano, Producer, Artistic Director\n\tNatasha Guiller: Piano\n\tLiko Yamane: Piano\n\tSam Schroeter: Clarinet\n\tJacob Kang: Cello\n\tOwen Lantz: Cello\n\tSakura Sone: Violin\n\tAbigail Goncharenko : violin\n\tAustin and Angela Tang: Piano and Violin"
      }
    ],
