    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Murray & Peter Present the return of WAR On The Catwalk hosted by Alyssa Edwards!\n\nGet ready for your favorite queens performing live on stage. We’ve got Myki Meeks, Jane Don’t, Darlene Mitchell, Juicy Love Dion, Silky Ganache, Discord Addams and Aurora Matrix.\n\nThe Meet & Greet starts at 6pm. Please note that the M&G is an add-on ticket. The show starts at 8pm. There will be a 20-minute intermission."
