    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Vancouver-based group MA:Q, led by Filipina Canadian Mary Ancheta, are returning to the NAC. The band brings their groove-driven modern jazz, funk, blues and soul. Rooted in jazz, fueled by rhythm, and always pushing forward. MA:Q have toured in Australia and were invited to perform in Japan at the 2025 Canadian Pavilion. Inspired by her film scoring, Mary creates her own brand of cinematic jazz. The group has opened up for The Headhunters, BADBADNOTGOOD, and Parlour Greens. Get your advance tickets, as Mary's last show..."
      }
    ],
