    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Celebrate 50 years of raw, uncut, and legendary comedy as the Yuk Yuk’s 50th Anniversary Tour arrives at the National Arts Centre on Saturday, February 20th!\n\n\nSince anti-establishing themselves in 1976, Yuk Yuk's has become the undisputed backbone of Canadian standup comedy, serving as the launchpad for global entertainment icons like Jim Carrey, Norm Macdonald, Russell Peters, Howie Mandel and many more.\n\n\nThe 50th Anniversary Tour is a celebration honors that legacy with a killer lineup of today’s emerging comedy stars.\n\n\nExpect an electric,..."
      }
    ],
